# GHDRAGOA: part of GHDRAGON, loaded only while it is needed.
from GHDRAGOP import*
G_SEC3=(('Tara',15,31,"I'm Tara. Welcome/to Section 3, where/dreams end.#Just kidding!/...Mostly.","A Lumora! Okay,/your dreams might/NOT end here.|What is THAT?!/I'm the one whose/dreams are ending.|Stone and gold?/Section 3 just got/scary for ME."),('*Ugo',14,34,"I don't need an/intro. People/know me.#...You don't?/Rude.",'A Lumora? People/will know YOU now./Rude.|Nobody knows/what THAT is./Not even me.|Everybody will/talk about that/rock. Not me. Rude.'),('Wade',13,30,"Wade here. I'm/a fisherman. So is/my Pearlhorn.#We're fishing for/a win today.","A Lumora! The/best catch I've/ever seen!|That came from/deeper than any/fish I've caught.|Can't fish a rock./Can't beat one/either, I bet."),('Yuri',12,32,"Yuri. I paint my/dragon's wins on/its scales.#I'm running out/of room.","I'd paint that/Lumora on my/dragon's scales!|I don't have paint/dark enough for/that thing.|Gold cracks! It/already looks/painted!"),('Dot',12,30,"I'm Dot! I'm tiny,/but my dragon/isn't!#Size isn't/everything!","A Lumora! It's/even bigger than/my dragon!|That thing is/scary AND big!/Size IS everything!|A giant rock!/Okay, size is/kind of everything."),('Iris',15,35,"I'm Iris. My/dragon can see/every color.#And it sees you/losing.","My dragon sees/every color. It/sees stars now.|My dragon sees/every color. It/can't see THAT.|Gold, silver and/grey. My dragon/loves those colors."),('Kai',14,33,"I'm Kai. I surf/on my dragon's/back. Gnarly!#Let's ride, dude!","A Lumora!/Totally gnarly,/dude!|Dude... that is/NOT gnarly. That/is creepy, dude.|Dude, you can't/surf on a rock!/...Can you?"),('Gwen',13,31,"I'm Gwen, the/dragon doctor! I/fix hurt dragons.#Your dragon will/need me later.","A Lumora! I'd/love to check/its heartbeat!|I don't know how/to fix whatever/THAT is.|A stone dragon!/My bandages won't/stick to that."),('Pax',15,32,"Hi! I'm Pax. I love/peace and making/friends!#...Right after I/beat you, though.","A Lumora! Let's/be friends! After/I beat you.|I want to make/friends with that./...From far away.|Rocks are good/friends. They never/leave. Or move."),('Thea',14,36,"Thea. I collect/badges. I have 49.#You'll be/number 50.","A Lumora! You/should get a badge/just for that!|There's no badge/for whatever that/is. I'd know.|A rock dragon/badge! That'd be/number 50!"),('Xena',16,38,"I'm Xena, warrior/tamer! My dragon/and I are ONE!#Feel our/POWER!",'A Lumora! Our/POWER meets its/LIGHT!|Even a warrior/feels fear. That/thing... is fear.|A warrior made/of stone! Finally,/a real fight!'),('Bea',16,33,'Bea! Like a bee!/Buzz buzz!#...And yes, I/sting. Hard.',"Buzz! A Lumora!/Even bees like/stars!|Bees run from/smoke. I'm running/from THAT.|Stinging a rock/hurts the bee./I learned that."),('Ezra',16,37,"Ezra. I've studied/your fights. All/of them.#I have notes./Lots of notes.","A Lumora. Note:/change strategy./Big time.|My notes say/nothing about/that. NOTHING.|Note: stone./Note: gold./Note: I'm worried."),('*Flint',16,39,"Spark. Fire./Done.#That's how fast/this goes.","Lumora. Bright./Nice.|Dark. Too dark./Nope.|Stone. Fire won't/help. Ugh."),('Orin',16,36,'Orin. I forge/swords AND tame/dragons.#Both are hot./Both burn.',"A Lumora! I'd/forge a sword/from its starlight.|I've worked dark/forges. Never seen/THAT kind of dark.|Gold veins in/stone! Best metal/I've ever seen."),('Abel',17,34,"I'm Abel. I came/all the way from/across the sea.#I'm not going/home a loser.",'Across the sea/they only TALK/about Lumoras!|Nobody across the/sea has seen/anything like that.|I crossed the sea/to see THAT?/Worth the trip.'),('*Jax',17,40,"I used to be a/pirate. Now I'm/something worse.#A pirate with/a dragon.","A Lumora! My/pirate heart says/steal it. I won't.|Even pirates know/when to sail away./Like now.|Gold in the/rock! That's/treasure, matey!"),('Rue',17,38,"I'm Rue. You'll rue/the day you met me.#Get it? Rue?/...Nobody laughs.","You'll rue the/day... wait, a/Lumora? I rue it.|I rue the day/I saw that./Get it? ...Brr.|Rock beats me./Rue... ME./Oh no."),('*Vic',17,41,"My name? Let's just/say it's short/for victory.#My parents knew.","A Lumora? Victory/just got harder.|Short for victory./Not short for/'fight THAT'.|That rock is/short for/'I lose'."),('Lark',18,35,"Lark! I sing to my/dragon before every/fight. La la la!#This one's a sad/song. For you.","A Lumora! I'll/write a happy/song about it!|La la... la./I forgot the words./What IS that?|A rock song! I/finally get to/sing one!"),('Cyrus',18,42,"Cyrus. My family/has tamed dragons/for 300 years.#You're just/a beginner.",'A Lumora. My/family has met/only two.|300 years of/tamers. Not one/saw THAT.|My family never/tamed a rock./Until now?'),('*Hugo',18,44,"The biggest tamer/in the arena./Literally.#I'm 7 feet tall./Scared yet?","A Lumora! For/once I feel/small. Nice.|7 feet tall,/and I'm hiding./What IS that?|That rock is/bigger than me!/Feels weird."),('*Nell',18,40,"...#I don't smile./...Okay, maybe/when I win.","...#...I'm smiling./Don't tell anyone.|...#...I'm not smiling./At all.|...#...Okay. That's/cool. Fine."),('Una',18,43,"I'm Una. Number/one. Always.#Literally. Una/means one.","A Lumora! Number/one dragon. Ugh,/I'm number two.|That's not number/one. That's number/zero. Scary.|One rock dragon./Only one./Like me."),('Vera',18,45,"I'm Vera. I've won/every tournament/for 10 years.#Except one. We/don't talk about it.","A Lumora. In 10/years I've seen/only two.|10 years of/tournaments. Never/seen THAT.|Remember the one/I lost? Not to/that. Phew."),('Zoe',17,39,"I'm Zoe, and this/is my Abyssar./Pretty, right?#She's even prettier/when she wins.","A Lumora! Okay,/that's prettier/than my Abyssar.|Pretty? No./Scary. Super/scary.|Gold and stone!/Pretty AND tough./I'm jealous."),('Milo',18,41,"I'm Milo. My/Rootwyrm was a gift/from my grandpa.#He never lost./Neither will I.","Grandpa told me/about Lumoras./He'd love this.|Grandpa never/told me about/anything like that.|Grandpa liked/rocks. He'd have/LOVED that."),('Skye',17,42,"I'm Skye. My dragon/has never touched/the ground.#You won't either/after this hit.","A Lumora! Its/wings look like/the night sky.|That came from/somewhere darker/than the sky.|A rock that/flies? Now I've/seen everything."),('Wren',18,44,"I'm Wren, the last/one before the/Grandmaster.#Nobody has passed/me in two years.",'A Lumora. Maybe/you WILL get past/me.|Two years nobody/passed me. That/thing might.|A stone wall,/like me. Who/blinks first?'),('Grandmaster Zora',19,46,"So. You're the one/everyone whispers/about.#I am Grandmaster/Zora. Nobody has/ever beaten me.","Another Lumora.#Two stars in one/arena. Only one/will shine.|In all my years/I have never seen/such a creature.|Stone and gold./I thought I'd seen/it all. I was wrong."))
G_SEC2=(('Gus',7,19,"GUS! I'M GUS! I/YELL A LOT!#SORRY! NOT SORRY!/LET'S FIGHT!","A LUMORA?! THAT'S/SO COOL I'M/YELLING MORE!|WHAT IS THAT?!/IT'S SO DARK! I/CAN'T STOP YELLING!|A ROCK DRAGON?!/WITH GOLD?! THAT'S/LOUD-LEVEL COOL!"),('Ash',8,18,"I'm Ash. Like the/dragon. Like what/fire leaves behind.#Guess which one/you'll be soon.","Stars on its wings./Fire could never/burn that bright.|That thing is/darker than ash./I don't like it.|Stone doesn't/burn. That's.../a problem for me."),('*Cole',9,21,'...#...My Glacius/does the talking.','...!#...Nice Lumora.|......#...What IS that?|...#...Whoa.'),('Bree',10,19,'Bree here! I talk/fast, I fight fast,/I win fast!#Ready? Set? GO!',"LumoraLumoraLumora!/I can't talk fast/enough for this!|Wait-what-is-that?/I've never seen/that! Not ever!|Is-that-a-ROCK?/That-MOVES?! Okay,/I'm-slowing-down."),('Kip',10,18,"Hi, I'm Kip! I'm/the youngest in/Section 2!#Don't go easy on/me. I won't!","Is that a real/Lumora?! Can I/touch it? Please?|Whoa... it's like/a shadow with/eyes. I'm scared!|A dragon made of/rocks?! I want to be/you when I grow up!"),('Ivo',11,22,"Ivo's the name./Thorns are my/game.#Touch my dragon/and you'll regret it.","Even my thorns/bow to a Lumora./Respect.|Thorns can't hurt/a shadow. What/is that thing?!|Thorns on stone/just snap. Great./Just great."),('Otto',11,20,"I'm Otto. I grow/the best turnips/in the land.#Also, I crush/tamers. Hobby.","A Lumora! Worth/more than every/turnip I've grown.|That's no turnip./That's no dragon/I know, either!|I hate rocks in/my field. But THAT/rock I'd keep!"),('Pia',9,18,"Pia! I've never/won a match.#But today feels/different!","A Lumora?! Okay,/today does NOT/feel different now.|What is THAT?!/Never mind. I've/lost already.|A walking boulder!/Maybe I'll win/next year..."),('*Quinn',8,23,"Fastest tamer/alive. Don't/blink.#You blinked. That's/one point for me.",'A Lumora. My fast/eyes saw that/one coming.|I blinked. And/that thing was/still staring.|Fast beats rock?/...Usually. Not/that rock.'),('*Max',7,24,'Maximum power./Maximum speed.#Minimum mercy.','Maximum Lumora./Maximum jealous.|Maximum creepy./Minimum idea what/that thing is.|Maximum rock./Maximum gold./Maximum unfair.'),('Eli',12,21,'Eli. I wake up at/dawn every day/to train.#What time did YOU/wake up? Thought so.','A Lumora! Like/the sky right/before dawn.|That thing is/darker than the/night before dawn.|Gold cracks, like/the sun rising/through stone.'),('Luna',12,25,"I'm Luna. I only/fight at night...#...but I'll make an/exception for you.",'Stars on its/wings... my kind/of dragon.|I love the night./But THAT is/darker than night.|It shines gold/in the dark./I like it.'),('Faye',13,20,"I'm Faye, and this/is Princess Pearl./Say hi, Pearl!#She says you're/going down.","Princess Pearl,/look! A Lumora!/Be polite!|Princess Pearl is/hiding behind me./Me too, honestly.|Pearl says rocks/aren't pretty. She's/WRONG this time."),('Hana',14,24,"I'm Hana. I've read/every dragon book/in the library.#I already know/your weak spot.","A Lumora! It's on/page 1 of every/dragon book I own!|That's in NO book/I've read. And I've/read them all!|Not in any book!/I'm writing my/own book now."),('Jade',14,22,"I'm Jade, and yes,/my dragon is a/Jadewyrm.#We match. It's/a whole thing.","A Lumora! We/don't match, but/I'll allow it.|That one matches/nothing. Not even/the night.|Gold and stone./That matches/everything."),('Dina',15,21,"I'm Dina! I braid/flowers into my/dragon's tail.#Pretty AND deadly!","A Lumora! I'd/braid starflowers/into its tail!|No flower would/grow near that./Brr.|I'd put flowers/in its cracks!/So pretty!"),('*Rex',13,26,"Names are for/winners. Call me/'The End'.#...Okay, that one/sounded cooler/in my head.","A Lumora. Fine./'The End' is still/coming. For you.|...'The End'/doesn't want to/fight that thing.|A rock dragon?!/...Call me/'The Beginning'."),('*Nora',15,25,'I found my dragon/in a cave nobody/came out of.#Want to know/why? Heh.',"Even my secret/cave had no/Lumora in it.|I've been in dark/caves. Nothing/THAT dark.|It looks like it/crawled out of MY/cave. Hmm."),('Sage',14,27,'I am Sage. I have/meditated for/three days.#I already know how/this ends.','A Lumora. My/meditation did/not foresee that.|I meditated/three days. I did/not see THAT.|Stone is calm./Stone is patient./Stone is... winning.'),('Sir Cedric',16,28,'I am Sir Cedric,/keeper of the/second gate.#Nineteen tamers fell/before me. You will/be the twentieth.','A Lumora at my/gate. A worthy/challenger at last.|In all my years/at this gate, never/one like THAT.|A knight of stone/and gold! Even my/gate bows to it.'))
G_TAMERS=(('Timmy',0,2,"Hi! I'm Timmy!/This is my first/tournament!#My Pyrrak is gonna/toast you!/...Probably."),('Lulu',4,4,"I'm Lulu. Aww, is/that your dragon?/It's so tiny!"),('Rocco',6,5,"Name's Rocco.#Rocks beat everything./That's science."),('Mira',2,7,"I'm Mira. I've never/lost. Not once. Ever./Don't ruin it."),('Dex',1,8,"Dex. Remember it,/because you'll be/crying it later."),('Captain Vex',3,11,"Captain Vex! I've/beaten 100 tamers./You're number 101."),('Duchess Ivy',5,13,'I am Duchess Ivy.#Kneel before my/Lichenwing, peasant!'),('Grim',8,14,"...I'm Grim.#...Your dragon looks/tired already."),('Sheen',23,15,"A hooded tamer with/yellow eyes steps up.#Name's Sheen. NOT/Shen. Never heard of/him. Heh.#Behold my super rare/GOLDEN DRAGON!/Shiny, huh? Heh heh."),('Aurora',10,16,"I'm Aurora, the/champion. So you/made it this far.#Impressive. Now watch/me end it."))
def G_tamer(s,i):
 return(G_TAMERS,G_SEC2,G_SEC3)[s][i]
